WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.125
Clique-free graphs, finally tamed.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.225
Forbid a clique. How big must the largest group of strangers be?

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.969
An entropy score keeps triangles rare, then

4
00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.829
a large stranger set falls out.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.306
Claimed: the log log loss is gone.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.208
Lean covers only part.
